{"id":"7977665ec7a5feef","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-universal-quantifier.md","title":"df-universal-quantifier-on-sets","display":"df-universal-quantifier-on-sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-universal-quantifier","aliases":["16-df-universal-quantifier"],"display":"df-universal-quantifier-on-sets","depends_on":["[[16-df-inverse-image-substitution]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-universal-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-universal-quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-quantifier-on-sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"093190b59177ac14\" href=\"?note=093190b59177ac14\" title=\"16-df-inverse-image-substitution\">16-df-inverse-image-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> (集合函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq I\">\\(X\\subseteq I\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall_u:\\mathcal P(I)\\to\\mathcal P(J)\">\\(\\forall_u:\\mathcal P(I)\\to\\mathcal P(J)\\)</span> (待定义的全称量词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\forall_u(X)\n\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid u^{-1}[\\{j\\}]\\subseteq X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\forall_u(X)\n\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid u^{-1}[\\{j\\}]\\subseteq X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u^{*}\\dashv\\forall_u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u^{*}\\dashv\\forall_u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall Y\\subseteq J\\bigr)\\bigl(\\forall X\\subseteq I\\bigr)\\\nu^*Y\\subseteq X\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\subseteq\\forall_uX.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall Y\\subseteq J\\bigr)\\bigl(\\forall X\\subseteq I\\bigr)\\\nu^*Y\\subseteq X\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\subseteq\\forall_uX.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>伴随的子集等价式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"040fbbfdb52f2389\" href=\"?note=040fbbfdb52f2389\" title=\"16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets\">16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-inverse-image-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"093190b59177ac14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-inverse-image-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets","status":"resolved","id":"040fbbfdb52f2389","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"伴随的子集等价式见 [[16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq I","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall_u:\